// A call through a function value charges as the named call of `cost_fn_call_named.si`: the call node, the copies of the arguments, and the body block. The callee charges as an expression, here one local name for each call, and no function name charges. The binding of the name outside the loop pays once. The fuel equal to the total of `cost` succeeds, and one unit less gives `S015`.
// FUEL 293
// TOP M()
comptime fn take(a: [Nat; 8], n: Nat) -> Nat {
    return n;
}
module M() domains() {
    let big = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7];
    let f = take;
    comptime for i in 0..4 {
        let r = f(big, 2);
    }
}
